/vendor/
/composer.lock
/.phpunit.cache/
/phpunit.xml

# Ralph PHP's own runtime data: the state database, the logs and the memory
# notes. "ralph init" writes this rule too; it ships here so that a copy of the
# example reads cleanly in "git status" from the first run.
/.ralph/runtime/

# This example tracks its task checklist, so that the checkbox Ralph PHP ticks
# shows up as a change you can read. "ralph init" sees the negation and leaves
# it alone.
!/.ralph/tasks.md
